                        "entry_id": "8c19611d-2d09-3d3c-9763-56d553b5ae4d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The reflexive of the royal or editorial we: myself (as used by one who is a monarch, writer or speaker when referring to oneself as we)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "first-person",
                            "pronoun",
                            "reflexive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f53f3680-2b8f-40e8-a6db-04cc69ee841d",
                                "sense_id": "aa1bc96c-d304-389b-bec9-ccdf425e52c8",
                                "text": "In the present study, we will limit ourself to the simplest of cases."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11c1542e-fcfc-42f6-8be5-25436d59980b",
                                "sense_id": "aa1bc96c-d304-389b-bec9-ccdf425e52c8",
                                "text": "Without in any way committing ourself upon this point, we have merely to observe, that we are ready to receive sealed offers containing a full specification of age, temper, appearance, and condition[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "282664c0-c757-4f4b-9cf3-61463ed07295",
                                "sense_id": "aa1bc96c-d304-389b-bec9-ccdf425e52c8",
                                "text": "He then offered to guide us down to see for ourself, but one look down that dark hole to the water about 60 feet below completely dampened our speluncean ardor."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "193b13c3-e798-3bda-ac15-7c3ad52a2af3",
                        "entry_id": "8c19611d-2d09-3d3c-9763-56d553b5ae4d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The reflexive of the generic we: oneself."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "first-person",
                            "pronoun",
                            "reflexive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "371bcee8-f413-4bff-a573-7395481f7899",
                                "sense_id": "193b13c3-e798-3bda-ac15-7c3ad52a2af3",
                                "text": "We should love our neighbor as ourself."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ccc009ea-60d9-3f4f-b436-aba51cc11f54",
                        "entry_id": "8c19611d-2d09-3d3c-9763-56d553b5ae4d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Reflexive of \\\"we\\\" referring to an individual person being addressed, especially a person in the speaker's care."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "first-person",
                            "form-of",
                            "reflexive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ae913345-0e0d-4001-bb54-76c010224171",
                                "sense_id": "ccc009ea-60d9-3f4f-b436-aba51cc11f54",
                                "text": "Hello Mrs Miggins. Did we manage to wash ourself this morning?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7327f839-2f3c-4da1-9c44-10b1c521d0af",
                                "sense_id": "ccc009ea-60d9-3f4f-b436-aba51cc11f54",
                                "text": "Well done Timmy! Did we make that model ourself?"
                            }
                        ]
